---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — GitHub APK Store"
  description="GitHub APK Store privacy policy. No data collected, no cookies, no tracking."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: March 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">Summary</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-text-primary">We collect nothing.</strong> No personal data, no analytics,
          no cookies, no tracking pixels, no fingerprinting. This site is a static HTML page served
          from GitHub Pages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">Data Collection</h2>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>No personal information is collected</li>
          <li>No cookies are set by this website</li>
          <li>No analytics or tracking scripts are loaded</li>
          <li>No external fonts, CDNs, or third-party resources are loaded</li>
          <li>No forms collect or transmit any data</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">Local Storage</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          This site uses <code class="bg-surface px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-text-primary">localStorage</code>
          solely to remember if you dismissed the PWA install prompt. No other data is stored locally.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">External Links</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          When you click a download button or repository link, you are redirected to
          <strong class="text-text-primary">github.com</strong>. GitHub has its own
          <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-primary underline hover:text-accent-hover">privacy policy</a>
          which applies to your interaction with their platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">Hosting</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          This site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may collect standard server logs (IP address,
          user agent, timestamps) as part of their hosting infrastructure. Refer to GitHub's privacy
          policy for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          For questions about this privacy policy, please open an issue on our
          <a href="https://github.com/BEKO2210/GITHUB_APP_STORE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-primary underline hover:text-accent-hover">GitHub repository</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
